# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Poniższe pola są zawarte w rekordzie logu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pole            | Typ      | Opis                                                                                    |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Wymagane | Definiuje konto i instancję dziennika przepływu, w której publikowany jest log.         |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Wymagane | Określa, czy IBM zapisuje kopię rekordu do celów operacyjnych.                          |\n"
"| message         | Wymagane | Opis wygenerowanego logu.                                                               |\n"
